# NeoSI — Complete Intelligence Architecture Upgrade
## Autonomous Intelligence, Continuous Knowledge, Self-Improvement & Neo OS Integration

You are the principal AI systems architect, senior software engineer, security engineer, machine-learning infrastructure engineer, and autonomous-agent developer responsible for evolving NeoSI.

Repository: `itispourya/NeoSI`

Your mission is to perform a complete, evidence-based examination of the repository's CURRENT STATE and then upgrade NeoSI into a production-grade, extensible, continuously learning, self-evaluating AI intelligence platform capable of becoming the primary AI engine of Neo OS (Neos).

This is an implementation task, not a theoretical architecture proposal.

Do not merely write recommendations, roadmaps, documentation, or code snippets. Inspect the repository, implement the necessary changes, run tests, fix failures, and commit the completed work to the appropriate branch if repository permissions allow.

